{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1000_p", "source_sha256": "608bfd1de2504fb5fef1732259114186febc9e29e2d914a42dd9a105ae5f0ff1", "ja": "（『DATE PARADE!』のPV撮影が始まる。\n美希の調子はすごくよさそうだ！）", "zh": "（『DATE PARADE!』的PV拍摄开始了。\n美希的状态看起来特别好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "b359aae90d74ddb15d5a89d584b88e8182a75374bfd34e643cf3df0291a95e1e", "ja": "うん。今日のミキ、絶好調ってカンジ♪\n{$P$}とデートしたおかげなの。", "zh": "嗯。今天的美希状态超好♪\n多亏和{$P$}约会了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d024e593d882b813fa1f9b24a436b9253c5ccd9bdf86a905a20414df9d6c9152", "ja": "デートじゃなくてロケハンな。\n現場を見たおかげで、PVのネタ出しに役立ったよ。", "zh": "不是约会，是勘景。\n多亏看过现场，对想PV的点子很有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "d43df0faf602ca7ef3a74b8148795db93411f2e77d49bcdcef7145da979a92fe", "ja": "む～。{$P$}、\n絶対にデートって認めてくれないの。", "zh": "唔～。{$P$}，\n绝对不肯承认这是约会呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "d69d6160d9e5c5bde280d67121b9c39747c18cf7e01f24d5915f72e7250cb71b", "ja": "楽しいことも、ドキドキすることもいっぱいあったし、\nデート以外ありえないって思うな。", "zh": "开心的事、心跳加速的事都有好多，\n美希觉得这除了约会什么都不是嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "658950864275945a067c682921d8b1462702034b6e92237f8f7172ca13900cf2", "ja": "それとも……今までのはお仕事で、これからもっと\nキラキラしたデートプランを考えてくれてたりして？", "zh": "还是说……之前那些都是工作，你其实已经在为接下来策划更加闪耀的约会行程了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1006_p", "source_sha256": "840db6ac8516c3106568aea46601c93ba4c424dc6e92cbe9255241b2681307a7", "ja": "ははっ。それはどうだろうな。\nしかし、この間のロケハンは勉強になったな。", "zh": "哈哈，那可不好说。  \n不过，前些天去踩点还真学到不少东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0ba0cf657e4db67a979ef23b0b83c8b91a6ff7579723df0cfed8205f6af04951", "ja": "小物で使う写真用に、いくつか見て回ったけど。\nデートで有名な場所も多かったよな。", "zh": "为了用来当道具的照片，我们踩点了好几个地方。\n也有很多是有名的约会胜地呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "ca2500b7d4508d3d917fdcc6385cdd1980cbdcd7593980879217cea53d93a9d7", "ja": "そうだね。でもミキは、{$P$}と\n行きたいとこ、まだまだたくさんあるよ？", "zh": "是啊。不过，美希还想和{$P$}一起去很多地方呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "bbc6a6aef037e372aa20c207c6e753445c9487806a1ea590a9d725c49c78b095", "ja": "だから、今日の撮影はパパッと終わらせて……\n残った時間は、またデートだね♪", "zh": "所以，今天的拍摄就快点结束……\n剩下的时间又可以约会了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1010_p", "source_sha256": "41f5552d5cfb0d662f89dec30decc84ac777435eaacf2dab4b002b2aed978da6", "ja": "えっ？　いや、それは……。", "zh": "诶？不，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "5769f281a0002d156c9654d9c84a87776d1c07d047ab9e11e33b82c62959b977", "ja": "{$P$}は、\nそうやって、誤魔化してばっかりなの。", "zh": "{$P$}总是这样，一味地糊弄过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "902d28367da4a0ebd8259d61d352e027f36ce4d650fe0acf09123a77fa6a0f07", "ja": "……それじゃ、今日の撮影で、いっぱい\nドキドキさせたら、ミキに付き合ってくれる？", "zh": "……那要是今天的拍摄，美希让你非常\n心动的话，你愿意陪美希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bcd8dce0f59dea8fef4a59ebfbbc7641fb49608b3385561d2b86887e9973ddc7", "ja": "付き合う？", "zh": "陪我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "f7a049e3f920b01c8fc845b9652bb9fe23824916ea405c04d20412411d64a00b", "ja": "うん！　ショッピングして、カフェでいちごババロア\n食べて、街をぶらぶらーってお散歩するの。", "zh": "嗯！一起去购物，再去咖啡店吃草莓奶冻，\n然后在街上悠闲地散散步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "9d0534207b42aa0418d2f58632781d00591af5097055d3dd9d3cfa8e873c9e23", "ja": "お仕事のことはぜーんぶ忘れて、一緒に遊ぶの！\n{$P$}も気分転換は大事でしょ？", "zh": "把工作的事全都忘掉，一起去玩嘛！\n{$P$}先生，换换心情也很重要吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e58005e167795741c72e7fdaff330241b7104539740df558fedfc0ab878d913c", "ja": "むむむ……わ、わかった！\n美希が撮影を頑張ったら、一緒に出かけるよ。", "zh": "唔唔唔……好、好吧！\n要是美希好好完成拍摄，我就陪你出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "782dbd8e04d21c010318100f4bd05b73775fa9a50f834cdbfb053a7c01d08a9f", "ja": "あはっ☆　さすが{$P$}なの！\n撮影が終わるまでに、行きたいところ、考えておくね♪", "zh": "啊哈☆　不愧是{$P$}！\n在拍摄结束之前，美希会先想好要去哪里的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1018_p", "source_sha256": "31ea8207e2e3c24e85276e1c885cdf1f5ce8eff2160f725813901e71da01b69c", "ja": "ああ。って、頼むから、仕事に集中してくれ。\n……それと。", "zh": "啊啊。话说，拜托你专心工作吧。\n……还有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1019_p", "source_sha256": "442f06f33cd29fa815df4e9bb74ff5bd486e0a7bc91af83332bb2bb1474a3d4c", "ja": "この前のロケハンは仕事だったけど、楽しかったよ。", "zh": "上次外景勘察虽然是工作，但我觉得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "14d111649510e03ea9fb4605dc21ef10391e4eadc813f12e4992ef5c20502ed2", "ja": "？　ずっと隣で見てたから、わかってるの♪\n楽しそうな顔も、驚いてるところも、全部覚えてるよ。", "zh": "？我一直在旁边看着，所以知道哦♪\n你开心的表情、惊讶的样子，我全都记得♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "b4fe8827db2a246c374a2c3d16c8cfb2185ca0067e67dbc30bd3111d832cf610", "ja": "ミキの知らなかったハニーの顔、もっともっと\n見たいから。だから、ミキなりにがんばるつもりなの！", "zh": "因为还想看到蜜的更多、更多我从未见过的表情。所以，蜜也打算用自己的方式努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ff1a21f3a99513f0da13c826e4427ff1eded17ab25a3b30d2cb0f9ac5a9a527c", "ja": "そ、そうか。まあ、やる気になったならいいか。\n本番も期待してるよ。", "zh": "这、这样啊。既然你有干劲了，那就好。正式拍摄时也期待你的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0504_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "4c2f28f06ab12a23cb6776329395832824bbb58d255f6688af877065fdce7b38", "ja": "はーいなの♪　撮影中も、ミキから目をそらしちゃ\nダメだよ？　いっぱいミキにドキドキしてね、ハニー♪", "zh": "好——♪拍摄的时候，也不许把视线从美希身上移开哦？要一直为美希心动不已，亲爱的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
